#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<p>...that right-clicking on any tab allows for the changing of the tab text "
"color?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...uñ-çirtü aşa biredäge tabaqnıñ yazma tösen üzgärtep bula\n"

#: tips.cpp:8
msgid ""
"<p>...that the tab text color can be changed with the code \\e[28;COLORt "
"(COLOR: 0-16,777,215)?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...biredäge tabaqnıñ yazma tösen \\e[28;TÖSt kertep tä üzgärtep bula (TÖS: "
"0-16,777,215)\n"

#: tips.cpp:13
msgid ""
"<p>...that the code \\e[8;ROW;COLUMNt will resize Konsole?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...\\e[8;YUL;BUYt kertep, Konsol ülçämen üzgärtep bula\n"

#: tips.cpp:18
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can start a new standard session by pressing the \"New\" button "
"in the tabbar?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...tabaq tiräsendäge \"Yaña\" töymäsenä çirtep yaña sessi açıp bula.\n"

#: tips.cpp:23
msgid ""
"<p>...that pressing and holding the \"New\" button on the tabbar will display a "
"menu of sessions to select?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...tabaq tiräsendäge \"Yaña\" töymägä çirtüdän soñ töymä çibärelmi ikän, "
"anda çıqqan saylaq aşa başqa sessine saylap bula.\n"

#: tips.cpp:28
msgid ""
"<p>...that pressing Ctrl+Alt+N will start a new standard session?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...Ctrl+Alt+N basqanda yaña sessi açıla.\n"

#: tips.cpp:33
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can cycle through the Konsole sessions by holding down the Shift "
"key and\n"
"pressing the Left or Right Arrow keys?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...Shift töymäsen totıp, Sulğa/Uñğa Uqlar töymälärenä basıp Konsol sessiläse "
"aşa küçep bula.\n"

#: tips.cpp:39
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can get a 'Linux console-like' terminal? \n"
"<p>Hide Konsole's menubar, tabbar and scrollbar, select the Linux font\n"
"and the Linux Colors schema and apply the full-screen mode. You might also \n"
"want to set the KDE panel to auto-hide.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...'Linux konsolı sıman' terminal açıp bula.\n"
"<p>Konsolnıñ saylağın, tabaq tiräse belän çornawtiräsen sünderep, Linux Töslär "
"Caylawın saylap, täräzäne tulayım cäyep quyarğa ğına kiräk. KDE'nıñ eştiräsen "
"dä üzennän yäşerelsen itep caylarğa bula.\n"

#: tips.cpp:47
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can rename your Konsole sessions by clicking with the right "
"mouse\n"
"button and selecting \"Rename session\"? The change will be reflected in the\n"
"Konsole tabbar, making it easier to remember the content of the session.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...küseneñ uñ töymäsenä basu aşa \"Sessi Adı...\" keremen saylap, ul sessi "
"adın üzgärtep bula. Yaña adı tabaq tiräsendä kürsäteläçäk. Alay itep sessi "
"eçtälegen ciñelräk istä totıp bula.\n"

#: tips.cpp:54
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can rename a Konsole session by double-clicking its tab?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...Konsol sessiseneñ adın üzgärtü öçen, ike-çirtü qullanası.\n"

#: tips.cpp:59
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can activate the menu with the Ctrl+Alt+M shortcut?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...Ctrl+Alt+M çaptırmasına basıp, saylaqnı açıp bula.\n"

#: tips.cpp:64
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can rename your current Konsole session with the Ctrl+Alt+S "
"shortcut?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...Ctrl+Alt+S çaptırmasına basıp Konsol sessiseneñ adın üzgärtep bula.\n"

#: tips.cpp:69
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can create your own session types by using the session \n"
"editor which you can find under \"Settings->Configure Konsole...\"?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...saylaqnıñ \"Caylaw->Konsol...\" keremen saylap sessi üzgärtkeçen açıp "
"bula. Anıñ aşa sessineñ yaña tören yasap bula.\n"

#: tips.cpp:75
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can create your own color schemes by using the schema editor\n"
"which you can find under \"Settings->Configure Konsole...\"?\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...saylaqnıñ \"Caylaw->Konsol...\" keremen saylap sessi üzgärtkeçen açıp "
"bula. Anıñ aşa töslärne üzençä köyläp bula.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:82
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can move a session by holding down the middle mouse button over "
"the tab?\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...küseneñ üzäk töymäsenä basıp, tabaqnı küçerep bula.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:88
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can reorder the session tabs with \"View->"
"Move Session Left/Right\" menu\n"
"commands or by holding down the Shift and Ctrl keys and pressing the Left or "
"Right \n"
"Arrow keys?\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...saylaqnıñ \"Küreneş\" kereme aşa, yä ki Shift töymäsen totıp Sulğa/Uñğa "
"töymäläre aşa tabaqlarnıñ tezeleşen üzgärtep bula.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:96
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can scroll pagewise in the history by holding down the Shift key "
"\n"
"and pressing the Page Up or Page Down keys?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...Shift töymäsen totıp PgUp/PgDn töymäläre aşa uzğan bitlärne çornap alırğa "
"bula.\n"

#: tips.cpp:102
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can scroll linewise in the history by holding down the Shift key "
"\n"
"and pressing the Up or Down Arrow keys?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...Shift töymäsen totıp PgUp/PgDn töymäläre aşa uzğan yullarnı çornap alırğa "
"bula.\n"

#: tips.cpp:108
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can insert the clipboard by holding down the Shift key and \n"
"pressing the Insert key?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...Shift töymäsen totıp Insert töymäse aşa alışukesä eçtälegen östäp quyarğa "
"bula.\n"

#: tips.cpp:114
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can insert the X selection by holding down the Shift and\n"
"Ctrl keys and pressing the Insert key?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...Shift+Ctrl töymälären totıp Insert töymäse aşa X alışukesä eçtälegen "
"östäp quyıp bula.\n"

#: tips.cpp:120
msgid ""
"<p>...that pressing Ctrl while pasting the selection with the middle mouse\n"
"button will append a carriage return after pasting the selection buffer?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...küseneñ üzäk töymäse aşa şaylanunı östäp quyğanda Ctrl töymäse basılğan "
"ikän, ul çaqta kertelgän kisäktän soñ yul küçekü östälänä.\n"

#: tips.cpp:126
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can turn off the terminal size hint under \"Settings->"
"Configure Konsole...\"?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...terminal ülçämeneñ äytelüen sayaqnıñ \"Caylaw->"
"Konsol...\" kereme aşa sünderep bula.\n"

#: tips.cpp:131
msgid ""
"<p>...that pressing Ctrl while selecting text will let Konsole ignore line "
"breaks?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...yazmanı saylağanda Ctrl basılğan kileş totılsa, Konsol şul saylanğan "
"kisäktäge yul küçerülären töşerep qaldıra.\n"

#: tips.cpp:136
msgid ""
"<p>...that pressing the Ctrl and Alt keys while selecting text will let Konsole "
"select columns?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...Ctrl+Alt töymälärenä basıp torıp yazmanı buylap saylarğa bula.\n"

#: tips.cpp:141
msgid ""
"<p>...that when a program evaluates the right mouse button you can still\n"
"get the right mouse button pop-up menu while pressing the Shift key?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...küseneñ uñ töymäsenä basıluların yazılım üze eşkärtä ikän, täräzäneñ "
"atılma saylağın Shift töymäse berlän uñ-çirtü aşa da açıp bula.\n"

#: tips.cpp:147
msgid ""
"<p>...that when a program evaluates the left mouse button you can still select\n"
"text while pressing the Shift key?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...küseneñ sul töymäsenä basıluların yazılım üze eşkärtä ikän, yazmanı Shift "
"töymäse berlän sul-çirtü aşa da saylap bula.\n"

#: tips.cpp:153
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can let Konsole set the current directory as the window title?\n"
"For Bash, put 'export PS1=$PS1\"\\[\\e]0;\\H:\\w\\a\\]\"' in your ~/.bashrc .\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...eş törgägeneñ yulın konsol başlığına da çığarıp bula.\n"
"Bash öçen, ~/.bashrc biremenä 'export PS1=$PS1\"\\[\\e]0;\\H:\\w\\a\\]\"' yulın "
"östise qala.\n"

#: tips.cpp:159
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can let Konsole set the current directory as the session name?\n"
"For Bash, put 'export PS1=$PS1\"\\[\\e]30;\\H:\\w\\a\\]\"' in your ~/.bashrc .\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...eş törgägeneñ yulın sessi adına da çığarıp bula.\n"
"Bash öçen, ~/.bashrc biremenä 'export PS1=$PS1\"\\[\\e]30;\\H:\\w\\a\\]\"' "
"yulın östise qala.\n"

#: tips.cpp:165
msgid ""
"<p>...that if you let your shell pass the current directory to Konsole within "
"the prompt\n"
"variable, e.g. for Bash with 'export PS1=$PS1\"\\[\\e]31;\\w\\a\\]\"' in your "
"~/.bashrc, then\n"
"Konsole can bookmark it, and session management will remember your current "
"working directory\n"
"on non-Linux systems too?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...eş törgägeneñ yulın konsolnıñ çaqıru yul başina çığarıp bula. Bash öçen, "
"~/.bashrc biremenä 'export PS1=$PS1\"\\[\\e]31;\\w\\a\\]\"' yulın östise qala.\n"

#: tips.cpp:173
msgid ""
"<p>...that double-clicking will select a whole word?\n"
"<p>When you don't release the mouse button after the second click you\n"
"can extend your selection by additional words when moving the mouse.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...ikele-çirtü aça süzne tulayım saylap bula.\n"
"<p>İkençe çirtüdän soñ küse töymäse basılğan qalsa, ul saylanunı başqa yullarğa "
"da kiñäytep bulaçaq.\n"

#: tips.cpp:180
msgid ""
"<p>...that triple-clicking will select a whole line?\n"
"<p>When you don't release the mouse button after the third click you\n"
"can extend your selection by additional lines when moving the mouse.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...öçle-çirtü aça yulnı tulayım saylap bula.\n"
"<p>Öçençe çirtüdän soñ küse töymäse basılğan qalsa, ul saylanunı başqa yullarğa "
"da kiñäytep bulaçaq.\n"

#: tips.cpp:187
msgid ""
"<p>...that if you drag &amp; drop a URL into a Konsole window you are presented "
"with a\n"
"menu giving the option to copy or move the specified file into the current "
"working directory,\n"
"as well as just pasting the URL as text.\n"
"<p>This works with any type of URL which KDE supports.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...Konsol täräzäsenä berär URL österep taşlağanda saylaq kilep çığa, anıñ "
"aşa ul URL kürsätkän biremen küçerep/kübäytep kenä tügel, anıñ yulın da kertep "
"bula.\n"
"<p>KDE totqan URL törläreneñ barısı belän alay itep eşlärgä bula.\n"

#: tips.cpp:195
msgid ""
"<p>...that the \"Settings->Configure Shortcuts...\" dialog allows you to define "
"keyboard shortcuts for actions\n"
"not shown in the menu, like activating menu, changing font and for listing and "
"switching sessions?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...saylaqta bulmağan ğämälär öçen \"Caylaw->Çaptırmalar...\" täräzäsendä "
"töylek çaptırmaların bilgeläp bula, ü.ö saylaq çığaru, yazu üzgärtü, sessine "
"almaştıru.\n"

#: tips.cpp:201
msgid ""
"<p>...that right-clicking over the \"New\" button in the left corner of the "
"tabbar or in an empty tabbar space displays a menu where you can set several "
"tab options?\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...tabaq tiräseneñ sulğı poçmağındağı \"Yaña\" töymäsenä yä buş urınında "
"uñ-çirtü aşa saylaq çığarıp, tabaqnıñ köylämälären kürep bula.\n"

#: zmodem_dialog.cpp:28
msgid "&Stop"
msgstr "&Tuqta"
